# Unreal Engine generated output
#
# Keep these in version control:
# - *.uproject and *.uplugin descriptors
# - Config/
# - Content/ (including *.uasset and *.umap)
# - Source/
# - Build/ resources such as icons
# - .vsconfig when it declares the shared Visual Studio workload
Binaries/
DerivedDataCache/
Intermediate/
Saved/

# Unreal local build, cook, and packaging output
# These generated paths live below the AMSim project rather than the repo root.
/AMSim/Build/Receipts/
/AMSim/Build/*/FileOpenOrder/
LocalBuilds/
StagedBuilds/
Releases/
*.uatbuildrecord

